  <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="Tag439" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deseret&amp;#160;Generation &amp;amp; Transmission&amp;#160;Cooperative is organized as a non-profit Corporation under the laws of the State of Utah and as of December 31, 2025 was owned by five (5) member cooperatives:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bridger Valley Electric Association, Inc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dixie Power, Inc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Garkane&amp;#160;Power Association, Inc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moon Lake Electric Association, Inc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mt Wheeler Power, Inc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During 2025 there were eleven (11) trustees, two (2) trustees from each of the five (5) member cooperatives; plus one (1) additional trustee nominated from among the representatives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
