&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 30.25pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;Revolving Credit&lt;/font&gt;&amp;#8212;As of December&amp;#160;31, 2025, the Cooperative had approximately $34,154,000 available under a $40,000,000 revolving credit line (the &amp;#8220;Credit Line&amp;#8221;), which expires December&amp;#160;30, 2030. There were no borrowings outstanding on the Credit Line&amp;#160;as of December&amp;#160;31, 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;Letters of Credit&lt;/font&gt;&amp;#8212; As of December&amp;#160;31, 2025, CFC provided letters of credit for approximately $5,459,000. The letters of credit reduced the available credit for advances under the Credit Line, leaving an available residual credit amount of approximately $34,541,000 under that facility while the letters of credit remain outstanding. As of December 31, 2025 Zions Bank provided a letter of credit for approximately $2,800,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-indent: -21.6pt; page-break-after: avoid; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '%0.'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'decimal'; -aw-list-number-values: '5'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 13.09pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;5.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="width: 13.09pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;INCOME TAXES&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
