&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;For the years ended December&amp;#160;31, 2025 and 2024, the differences between the effective tax rates and the U.S. Federal statutory rate of 21%, were as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 609px; height: 200px;" border="0" width="566" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;

&lt;tr style="mso-height-source: userset; height: 12.95pt;"&gt;
