&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 30.25pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"&gt;Deferred compensation fund is included in other noncurrent assets in the accompanying balance sheets, and in addition to the investments in the table above, includes approximately $443,000 and $1,241,000 of cash as of December&amp;#160;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. NRECA Pension restoration plan-invested assets is included in other noncurrent assets on the balance sheet, and in addition to the investments in the table above, there is approximately $575,000 and $214,000 of cash as of December&amp;#160;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. The methods and assumptions used to estimate the fair value of corporate debt instruments, commercial paper, and U.S. government securities, were observable quoted market prices for similar securities, and therefore, corporate debt instruments are classified as Level&amp;#160;2 instruments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-indent: -21.6pt; page-break-after: avoid; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '%0.'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'decimal'; -aw-list-number-values: '9'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 13.09pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;9.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="width: 13.09pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;SUBSEQUENT EVENTS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"&gt;The Cooperative has performed an evaluation of subsequent events through March 27, 2026, which is the date the financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/p&gt;
