&lt;td style="height: 11.1pt; width: 646.5px;" colspan="2" height="14"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; Accrued additions to utility plant at December 31, 2025, were approximately $2,751,000.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl67" style="width: 124.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="mso-height-source: userset; height: 11.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="height: 11.1pt; width: 520.6px;" height="14"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl71" style="width: 125.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl67" style="width: 124.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="mso-height-source: userset; height: 11.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="height: 11.1pt; width: 520.6px;" height="14"&gt;&amp;#160; During the year ended December 31, 2024:&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl71" style="width: 125.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl67" style="width: 124.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="mso-height-source: userset; height: 11.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="height: 11.1pt; width: 520.6px;" height="14"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; The Cooperative declared a return of patronage in the amount of $1,000,000&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl71" style="width: 125.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl67" style="width: 124.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="mso-height-source: userset; height: 11.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="height: 11.1pt; width: 520.6px;" height="14"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; which was accrued and unpaid at December 31, 2024. The amount was&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl71" style="width: 125.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl67" style="width: 124.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="mso-height-source: userset; height: 11.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="height: 11.1pt; width: 520.6px;" height="14"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; subsequently paid in January 2025.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl71" style="width: 125.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl67" style="width: 124.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="mso-height-source: userset; height: 11.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="height: 11.1pt; width: 646.5px;" colspan="2" height="14"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; Accrued additions to utility plant at December 31, 2024, were approximately $6,000.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="xl67" style="width: 124.1px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;

