      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Blue Mountain Energy, Inc.: Deseret Generation &amp; Transmission owns 100% of the membership interest in Blue Mountain Energy, Inc.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
